<h1 class="article-title">Electronic Ascending-Bid Auction of Part of the Property at Brīvības Street 94 (Auction Completed)</h1>
<div class="block_text mt-5 mb-4">
<div class="row">
<div class="col"><div class="col-12 output"><p><em><strong>Results of the property auction:</strong></em></p><p><em>On 12 September 2025, the electronic auction organised by the Liepāja Special Economic Zone Authority for part of the property at Brīvības Street 94, Liepāja, concluded. The highest bid of <strong>EUR 378,750.00</strong> (three hundred and seventy-eight thousand seven hundred and fifty euros), excluding value added tax, was made by <strong>SIA “Nordic Steel Latvia”</strong>, registration No. 40203671003, registered address: Krišjāņa Valdemāra Street 33-3F, Riga, LV-1010. The auction results were approved at the LSEZ Board meeting on 8 October 2025, Board Decision No. 103.</em></p><p>_____________________________________</p><p>The Liepāja Special Economic Zone Authority, unified registration No. LV90000329402, is holding an electronic ascending-bid auction for part of the property at Brīvības Street 94, Liepāja, cadastral designation 17000220059. The property includes buildings with cadastral designations 17000220059089 and 17000220059090, and parts of a land plot with a total area of approximately 21,778 m<sup>2</sup> (the area will be specified after surveying is completed).</p><p>The starting price is <strong>EUR 375,000.00</strong> (three hundred and seventy-five thousand euros), the bid increment is <strong>EUR 3,750.00</strong> (three thousand seven hundred and fifty euros), and the auction security deposit is <strong>EUR 37,500.00</strong> (thirty-seven thousand five hundred euros). The purchase price is payable as follows:</p><ul><li>Within 10 working days after the preliminary agreement enters into force, the purchaser pays an advance of 30% (thirty percent) of the purchase price.</li><li>The purchaser pays the remaining purchase price within two weeks after the purchase agreement is signed.</li></ul><p>The auction starts on <strong>12 August 2025 at 13:00</strong> and ends on <strong>11 September 2025 at 13:00</strong>.</p><p>Prospective bidders may register from 12 August 2025 at 13:00 until 1 September 2025 at 23:59 on the electronic auction website <a href="https://izsoles.ta.gov.lv/">https://izsoles.ta.gov.lv</a>.</p><p>Anyone wishing to participate must pay a security deposit of 10% (ten percent) of the property's starting price, namely <strong>EUR 37,500.00</strong> (thirty-seven thousand five hundred euros), by the registration deadline. The amount must be transferred to the LSEZ Authority account: Liepāja Special Economic Zone Authority, unified registration No. LV90000329402, AS “SEB banka”, account No. <strong>LV42UNLA0012000609480</strong>, with payment reference “Security deposit for the auction of the property at Brīvības Street 94”.</p><p>The auction is conducted electronically at <a href="https://izsoles.ta.gov.lv/" target="_blank">https://izsoles.ta.gov.lv</a>. For information about the property auction, call <strong>29294267</strong> or email <a href="mailto:raivo.spaks@lsez.lv">raivo.spaks@lsez.lv</a>.</p></div>
</div>
